## Run from VS Code

Press **F5** with one of the new configurations selected:

- **Module 14: MD (prompt for UniProt)** — asks for the accession + ns length
- **Module 14: MD P04637 (GPU, explicit)** — full quality run on TP53

Both use the project's `.venv` interpreter automatically because of the
existing `proteinFP.code-workspace` setting.

